      <title>We visit the ‘timeless, colourful and vibrant’ Bury Market attracting 1,200 coach parties a year</title>
      <link>https://www.manchesterworld.uk/news/we-visit-the-timeless-colourful-and-vibrant-bury-market-attracting-1200-coach-parties-a-year-5448519</link>
      <description>On a sunny and dry early spring Wednesday it’s not hard to see the attraction of Bury’s huge outdoor market. The place is bustling with shoppers, a hum of conversation drifts through the maze of aisles along with the occasional whiff of bread, cakes, fresh flowers and cooked breakfasts from the many cafés dotted about.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.manchesterworld.uk/news/we-visit-the-timeless-colourful-and-vibrant-bury-market-attracting-1200-coach-parties-a-year-5448519</guid>
